{"format":"ScriptStudio","version":1,"title":"Cherry Nights — example","characters":[{"id":"maya","name":"Maya","description":"Observant, quietly brave. Always notices the little things.","image":""},{"id":"jules","name":"Jules","description":"Maya’s old friend. Funny when nervous.","image":""}],"blocks":[{"id":"ac07460172294237ac290bd9716ca672","type":"scene","text":"Scene 1 — Rooftop, late evening","speaker":null,"delivery":""},{"id":"db169bca27764628b9b488d1cae3829e","type":"action","text":"A warm breeze moves the paper lanterns. Maya sets two cups of tea on the ledge.","speaker":null,"delivery":""},{"id":"cbc8b46a61a0436883cd643da7d74a14","type":"dialogue","text":"You remembered the cherry tea.","speaker":"maya","delivery":"softly"},{"id":"0dc6d8c1e44a4e65926749116fbaf9e0","type":"dialogue","text":"Some things are worth remembering.","speaker":"jules","delivery":"smiling"},{"id":"005a31aeaa834067bdce2ee7b05b4a15","type":"action","text":"For a moment, neither of them needs to say anything.","speaker":null,"delivery":""},{"id":"e2da6dc32d8242a9855467d6bb5e5eff","type":"scene","text":"Scene 2 — The walk home","speaker":null,"delivery":""}]}